Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/angle/angle/+/8502520
Reviewed-by: Shahbaz Youssefi <syoussefi@chromium.org>
Commit-Queue: Antonio Maiorano <amaiorano@google.com>
Reviewed-by: Ran Wang <wangra@google.com>
Reviewed-on: https://codereview.qt-project.org/c/qt/qtwebengine-chromium/+/783655
Reviewed-by: Moss Heim <moss.heim@qt.io>
